@merrymercy @hnyls2002 @cctry could one of you please help shepherd the code-owner review and enable baseline CI for the updated head with `/tag-and-rerun-ci`?

@zackyoray approved the previous head. This update is a rebase only: all seven patches are unchanged, now based on main at `62cee1b1` and including the required minimum base from #21065. The new head is `8513f1b14aa06bbc40facc13d9abf53ba99d376b`; GitHub verifies all seven commit signatures. I also updated the title to the required format.

Local lint/format, compilation, registered-test metadata validation, and all 37 supplemental source-isolated checks pass after the rebase. The earlier CI failures were title/authorization gates, not runtime test failures; the registered CPU suite and GPU E2E validation are still pending.
